cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Makkah and Madinah non-Saudi ownership zones"
abstract: >-
  The 22 designated zones in which non-Saudis may buy property in Makkah (12) and Madinah (10),
  with official boundaries from REGA's Saudi Properties portal, codes and names in English and
  Arabic, areas, measured distances to the Grand Mosque and the Prophet's Mosque, eligible buyers
  and permitted rights. Compiled by Zullfa.
